1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
1. In Settings > Channels, the admin selects Messenger
and clicks "Connect with Facebook".

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,400
2. Facebook Login opens in a secure window.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,400
3. The admin chooses which Facebook Page to connect
(pages_show_list). Other pages are blurred for privacy.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,400
4. The admin selects the business portfolio
(business_management).

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,400
6. AmbarCRM subscribes the Page to its webhook so messages arrive
(pages_manage_metadata).

7
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:34,900
7. The Page access token is validated (pages_read_engagement).
AmbarCRM shows "Ámbar Rojo Studios" as connected.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,400
8. From a customer's phone (right), we send a message
to the Facebook Page.

9
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:44,900
9. The message arrives in the AmbarCRM inbox
(pages_messaging, pages_read_engagement).

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,900
10. The agent opens the conversation and writes a reply.

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,900
11. The reply is delivered to the customer in Messenger
(phone, right).
